This is my second attempt at a Gelato Messina recipe (I messed it up first time as I didn't pay attention!) and I have to say.....BEAUTIFUL. 

You really need to try this one, yes there is a bit of heating up and temperature management but it is so worth it. 

You can buy the book online here:
https://gelatomessina.com/product/gelato-messina-the-recipes-book

You can also get it from Google Books if you're not based in Australia ( I wish I were 🌞🌞🌞🌞🌞🌞)

What you'll need:

670g Milk
100g Sugar
15g Skimmed Milk Powder
30g Dextrose (Glucose will work too)
5g Stablizer
180g White Chocolate Chopped 

I hope you like White Chocolate as it really tastes like it YUM.

